<mxCell id="blurb" value="PROPOSED DEPLOYMENT (Part 1 is currently a local notebook). Extract and process become two container entry points, coordinated by Step Functions Standard with ecs:RunTask.sync. Verify the container exit code and the completed S3 manifest before starting the next step; publish the Glue table only after all outputs pass validation. Package the notebook logic and S3 I/O before deployment." style="whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=15;fontColor=#334155;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#BBD9F0;spacing=6;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="24" y="890" width="900" height="190" as="geometry" /></mxCell>
